{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You fell asleep studying for exams\u2026 when you woke up the school was empty. Survive the night, identify what\u2019s wrong, and escape the loop or be stuck at school forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the demo version of Study Time Anomaly. In this demo, you can experience a small set of anomalies and endings. The game is also in development and content may change between the demo and released game. Feel free to join report any issues you encounter or provide suggestions on what you would like to see in the final game in our Discord! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now get to studying...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Search the school</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975320/extras/1bf4c1449b0114d30e6522f06094fb16.poster.avif?t=1760212358\" width=1170 height=582 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975320/extras/1bf4c1449b0114d30e6522f06094fb16.webm?t=1760212358\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975320/extras/1bf4c1449b0114d30e6522f06094fb16.mp4?t=1760212358\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something isn't quite right. You fell asleep while studying and are stuck in your school hallway...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find anomalies</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975320/extras/85a7981aebee95da4168a5f6407ce8b8.poster.avif?t=1760212358\" width=1170 height=582 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975320/extras/85a7981aebee95da4168a5f6407ce8b8.webm?t=1760212358\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975320/extras/85a7981aebee95da4168a5f6407ce8b8.mp4?t=1760212358\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for anomalies ranging from curious to lethal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escape... or not</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975320/extras/b041589c9b40763daad32590af2df29e.poster.avif?t=1760212358\" width=1170 height=582 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975320/extras/b041589c9b40763daad32590af2df29e.webm?t=1760212358\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975320/extras/b041589c9b40763daad32590af2df29e.mp4?t=1760212358\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the correct staircase to finally escape the loop and go home... or be stuck forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 30 anomalies to spot</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search the environment for anomalies and choose the correct stairs to escape</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anomalies that change across floors based on your decisions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No combat</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3975320?t=1760212358","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3975320?t=176